**Answer:**  
Voidwalkers are more versatile for leveling: their *Torment/Suffering* provides proactive threat control for multiple/non-humanoid mobs (critical when pulling groups), *Consume Shadows* offers out-of-combat regen (essential for solo questing), and *Sacrifice* boosts survival. Succubi excel at single-target humanoid quests (Seduction, Lash of Pain) but struggle with non-humanoids (Seduction fails) and rely on reactive threat reduction (Soothing Kiss), making Voidwalkers more reliable for general leveling chaos. [end of text]


